# ==============================================================================
# TabbyPatrol - Environment Configuration (.env)
# ==============================================================================
# TabbyPatrol uses LangChain's deepagents library to power a goal-aware agent
# with 4 specialized subagents:
#   1. classifier: evaluates tabs based on RELEVANCE TO GOAL (not generic category)
#   2. planner: turns natural-language requests into session study blocks
#   3. appeals_judge: adjudicates user disputes with grace allowances
#   4. coach: reviews session statistics and writes reflection reports
#
# If no API key is set, TabbyPatrol automatically runs in intelligent
# Offline Heuristic DeepAgent mode so you can demo and test offline with zero setup!
# ==============================================================================

# 1. OPTIONAL: Specific Model Identifier
# Format: provider:model_name
# Examples:
#   TABBY_MODEL=openai:gpt-4o-mini
#   TABBY_MODEL=anthropic:claude-3-5-haiku-latest
#   TABBY_MODEL=google_genai:gemini-2.0-flash
# If unset, TabbyPatrol auto-selects based on whichever API key is configured below.
# TABBY_MODEL=openai:gpt-4o-mini

# 2. PROVIDER API KEYS (Set whichever you have available):

# OpenAI (gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Anthropic (claude-3-5-haiku, claude-3-5-sonnet)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Google Gemini (gemini-2.0-flash, gemini-1.5-pro)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
